"""
realtime_front_shoulder_PRODUCTION.py
=====================================
Production front shoulder raise classifier.

Smooth velocity-based rep detection:
  REST → RISING → FALLING → CAPTURED → COOLDOWN → REST

No hard angle thresholds. No OOD rejection.
VAE latent z fused into classifier (Enhancement 2 only).

Keys: Q/ESC = quit    R = reset    S = set summary
"""

